{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_buildr_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_buildr_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"复还的羽兽","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_buildr_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"aee80daabd5dda6873be3f4f207c079e0618e6201ea56d2c15f221753abc0a06","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是......老汐斯塔吹来的风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天上盘旋着的海羽兽，也是飞到这里安家的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷......我找到了......走了这么久，我终于......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（深吸一口气）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我回来了——汐斯塔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"倒霉的事情都过去了！别再缠着我了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接下来——都是好日子了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......这是我的简历，它为什么在垃圾桶里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您不是说各种渠道都试过了，帮我想了很多办法，就是没有适合我的工作机会吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我的作品集，它看上去还没被人翻动过！就这么直接跟简历一起丢在垃圾桶里了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"安麦尔小姐，请您先冷静一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"我确实说过会帮您想办法，汐斯塔人力资源办公室会尽可能帮助每一位求职者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"但......没有人愿意找您合作，我也没有办法啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......为什么没人聘用我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您不用在乎我怎么想，您大可以直截了当地告诉我，这样我才能做得更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您放心，只要您给我一个进步的方向，我绝不会辜负您的期望！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"那......好吧，我就告诉你吧，虽然这个很难改。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"原因就是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"你的运气太差了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说我运气差......是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"看到这堆文件了吗？光今天投递来的简历就有这么高一堆！我一个人哪里看得过来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我倒是有个好办法，就像这样——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"职员随便抽出来一摞文件，丢进了垃圾桶里，纸堆矮了一截。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你明明都没有看过这些简历！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"没办法，我精力有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可看简历不就是你的工作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，我必须要指正你，我的工作是帮雇主挑选人才。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"能否给雇主带来好运气，才是我们现在最重要的考核标准。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟这几年汐斯塔实在是遭受了太多不幸，雇主们可不希望再遇到什么意外变故。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"而你的简历，就这样非常“幸运”地被我丢进了垃圾桶里......你说，怎么会有雇主聘用你这样的倒霉蛋呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒、倒霉蛋？先生，你......我真的很失望......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，我本来满怀期待地来这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都想好了，哪怕要我的只是一个小工程队，哪怕只是一个发实习工资的助理岗位，我也愿意去试试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你说没人看得上我，只是因为我运气不够好？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要干什么，你先别激动——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你等着，我会自己想办法的！我会证明自己......没有项目我自己找，没有团队我自己组！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁要你这些，这些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸！你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"安麦尔小姐，你冷静一点！别——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办公室职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"我的垃圾桶......你、你得赔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赔你个臭羽兽蛋！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g3_siestanewstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平静......平静......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一个不称职的市政厅职员，并不能说明什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汐斯塔官方城建公司的求职渠道行不通，私人建筑企业还会有机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果私人企业也行不通，我还可以挨家挨户去问街边的小工作室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汐斯塔到处都在施工，总会有地方收留我......吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汐斯塔......真的像爷爷说的那样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，别那么愁眉苦脸的！要不要尝尝汐斯塔的特色小吃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"我家店里的派，可是登上了汐斯塔旅游必吃榜呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"必吃榜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，别客气，拿好。首次光顾的客人免费品尝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢噢好，谢谢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嚼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女的眉头微微皱起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么了？你好像看上去不太喜欢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不是不是，挺好吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......怎么这么甜啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没吃过这么甜的酸橙派。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是酸橙派哦，是改良过的“甜橙派”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“甜橙派”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"其实就是在酸橙派上多加一点甜味酱啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......比较酸的那种酸橙派才是汐斯塔的特色小吃吧？我印象里，爷爷一直做的都是很酸的酸橙派。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他做馅料时，只会选那种通身青绿的橙子，带一点黄的都不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更不用说加这么甜的酱料......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，这么严格的做法，够老派。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，你爷爷是汐斯塔人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是汐斯塔人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？那你应该很久没有回过汐斯塔了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我出生后不久就全家搬到哥伦比亚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"怪不得，我就说你的口音怎么有股哥伦比亚人的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的小男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汉克！我要一份甜橙派！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，是小路特啊，你怎么又来我这里了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的小男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘——！不要告诉哈莉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的小男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）我要最甜的那一款！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，拿好喽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的小男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢汉克！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小男孩一把夺过店主手里的包装袋，一溜烟地跑走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然加了这么多蜂蜜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"不仅如此。这馅料里可是放了三倍的炼乳，派底还涂了一层焦糖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪不得那么甜，完全不能算是酸橙派了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，有什么办法呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"这些小孩子们，还有年轻游客，都喜欢更甜口的。为了更好卖一点，酸橙派也不得不改良口味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"如今的汐斯塔和过去可大不一样喽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座移动城市和爷爷口中的汐斯塔，好像真的不太一样了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"并不是一切都变得不一样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"汐斯塔人虽然接受了新的口味，但是偶尔还会怀念过去的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，这不是我们市政厅的新晋大红人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"今天怎么有空光顾我这小摊了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是刚好路过......也请给我包一份酸橙派吧，汉克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，不用那么客客气气的。过去在老汐斯塔的时候，我们可不是这么相处的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这位先生，也是市政厅的......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在把风情街的老店都搞得面目全非之后，我很高兴我们还能像过去一样相处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，改建的事算是处理得不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"市政厅给了我们不少歇业补贴，听说之后还会有更多扶持政策，大家已经很满意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"就算有人像我一样闲不住，不也还能出来摆摊，打发时间吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"拿好，你的酸橙派，酸得掉牙，风情街这帮人的口味我最清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......多亏了大家配合我的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，汉克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......请问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？这小姑娘怎么还在这儿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问二位先生，你们口中的风情街，现在还在改建施工吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"何止是“还在”，简直可以说是没日没夜地在施工！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"街坊里可都传开了，那几个外国富商就等着风情街改建好，把那一片打造成全泰拉最大的水上乐园风景区呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汉克，没有那么夸张......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"改建，不过是为了帮着老街的居民们，尽快适应在移动城市上的新生活罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟汐斯塔，可不能总是沉湎在过去的美好回忆中啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（汐斯塔的过去......在那条风情街里，还能看得到。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可就连这么一点美好回忆，也......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，风情街现在还在招工吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g13_siestafirstimpression"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐器店女老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"轻一点，我的天......小伙子们，这些可都是我最重要的宝贝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐器店女老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我早说不能把它们都送到那间新建好的仓库里......它们还......是我还没有做好准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐器店女老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它们不该这样不见天日的，你说对吗，我的爱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐器店男老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，亲爱的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐器店男老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到我们的“熔岩裂隙”音乐烧烤店建好之前，它们还派不上用场，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐器店女老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这些可都是我的奶奶传给我的妈妈，我的妈妈再传给我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐器店女老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要知道，我一有时间就会把它们仔细保养，给它们擦得锃亮，轻轻敲一下就会有清脆的响！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐器店女老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"果然，我还是不舍得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧老板！无论是吉他还是架子鼓，还有那些......是叫木琴还是竖琴来着，我们都包好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每一件都垫上了几层缓震垫，包装也封得严丝合缝的，别说进水了，就连一丁点潮气都进不了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"估计等你们的......音乐烧烤店开业时，这些乐器也不会走音。我们绝不会砸了你们的招牌的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐器店女老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀！谁跟你说那些乐器是我的宝贝了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐器店女老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的宝贝是那些烧烤架！你们也给它们封好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？原来那些不是废品吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐器店女老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你——你在说什么？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里就是风情街......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看上去......这家店在施工过程中发生了点小误会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们好像吵得越来越凶了，我们不去劝一劝吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用担心，那不是在吵架。居民们只是还需要些时间去和“旧时光”告别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟这条街上的大部分店铺，比你我加起来还要年长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听过......在汐斯塔海边时，那条街的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在花花绿绿的遮阳伞下面，烧烤架在沙滩上搭起来，有比浪潮还要喧闹的乐声，居民们聚在一起办晚会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷说，那时的汐斯塔还没有完全建好，漂亮的大楼很少，往来的游客也少......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过人们的快乐，却一点也不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的爷爷一定和我的爷爷很有话聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科斯达先生的爷爷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是一个乐观又脾气古怪的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢......老人们好像都是这样吧，有点古怪，又总是很乐观......明明他们年轻的时候遇到的困难也是一个接一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反倒是我现在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女怀着思绪，抬眼望向市中心的方向——\n远处的大楼很高很漂亮，路口有汽车正驶过干净宽敞的街道。\n游人来来往往，有几个穿着时髦的正停留在街角，对着墙壁上不知是谁留下来的火山涂鸦拍照。\n明明这里的一切对于爷爷来说，已经如同他所期待的那样。\n可对自己而言，这里的一切还是很遥远，就像自己仍然在赶来的路上。\n一时间，少女觉得好像有一整颗剥了皮的酸橙梗在喉咙里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，说起来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天看到我的同事们在市政厅工作群里聊起了一位“垃圾桶除灭者”的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说了那位年轻女孩来汐斯塔的经历，不可谓不波折。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走了那么多弯路还能坚持来到这里，她一定也是个很乐观的人吧？我很佩服她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得，她好像也叫安麦尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时是我太冲动了......我本来也打算之后亲自去找那位职员先生道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，科斯达先生。市政厅的损失，我也会照价赔偿的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不是来找你讨赔偿的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是顺路去买酸橙派，顺路替我不负责任的同事完成他本该完成的分内的工作——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮助一位前来汐斯塔求职的青年渡过她的职业危机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟我很能理解那种，明明有一身的力气，却无处施展、处处碰壁的感觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，科斯达先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我到底该怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如先问问你想怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......想怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前......是想问问风情街有没有哪家店的改建工作还需要人手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过刚才路过乐器店时，那边发生的事情......让我有点怀疑自己到底能不能做好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我对新汐斯塔一无所知，对旧汐斯塔的认识也只停留在爷爷给我讲的那些故事里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从黑曜石音乐节，到搬上移动城市，再到我来到这里以后，听居民们提起的那场向汐斯塔火山告别的晚会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我错过了这么多......我并不了解现在的汐斯塔需要什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确实不了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，那又怎么样呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想必你的爷爷刚到那座海边小城的时候，也不了解它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的你，不是和他年轻时一样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有的是时间来了解一座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不确定我能不能......我已经浪费了很多时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用想那么多了，我们走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......要去哪儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带你去做你一开始想去做的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g2_siestacommercialstreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"与白天时不同，临近夜晚的风情街施工声渐渐偃息，到处都洋溢着居民们欢聚时的热闹气氛。\n除了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这家店......连招牌都拆掉了，这是什么味道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是咖啡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，这里曾是一家咖啡店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未来一段时间，就麻烦你在这里工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里工作？是要改建这家店铺吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......店主在哪里？他有初步的店铺改建意向吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"改建之后，这里还要做咖啡店？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"短暂的沉默之后，市政厅职员给出了他的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老店主已经不在了，这家店也没有人继承，所以你的工作并不是改建它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是改建，那是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拆掉它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拆掉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说......要把这间店铺整个都拆掉？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"市政厅职员点了点头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎么行，我做不到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还会有别的工人和你一起，你不需要担心人手的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于你的工资......会在市政厅的风情街改建专项资金里出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你同意接下这份工作，我会代表市政厅与你签署劳务合同，来保障你的权益。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，我不是指这些......我是指这家店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些桌椅，这些柜橱......能看出老店主曾经真的很仔细地在打理它们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要把它们都拆掉，也太可惜了......这些明明都是老汐斯塔的美好回忆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安麦尔，你听说过候羽和留羽的故事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"候羽......留羽......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是两个有点熟悉的词，它们代表什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我小的时候，我的爷爷曾给我讲过一种羽兽的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相传在那片沙滩上，曾经生活着一种十分古老的羽兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那片沙滩......是指老汐斯塔吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过那种羽兽遍布天空与林间的时候，老汐斯塔还不存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至可能连汐斯塔火山都还不存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......连火山都不存在，是那么久远的年代吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那种羽兽有什么故事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经，它们并不能被称为“一种羽兽”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是一个复杂的，成员形态与习性各异的族群。族群中包含着从这片大地的各处飞来的、不同品种的候羽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起初，它们就在沙滩边的林子里聚集。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们也会有争执，一些羽兽离开了，也有一些选择留了下来，筑起了巢，共同哺育后代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后它们真正混成了同一个种群，吃着同一种果子，唱着同一首歌......于是，它们在此处变成了留羽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的爷爷很喜欢这个故事，他觉得，这种古老羽兽和汐斯塔很相像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......现在还能看到这种羽兽吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕是不能了......在故事的最后，一场连年的大雨引起了海水的倒灌，淹没了那片林子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那种羽兽也就此销声匿迹了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......安麦尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这只是一个传说故事罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现实中的汐斯塔，可比那种羽兽要好运得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是忽然想起来，我在哪里听过“候羽”和“留羽”了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷，酸橙酱罐子上的，是什么字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和善的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噢，那个是“汐斯塔”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“汐斯塔”？什么是“汐斯塔”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和善的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，原来我们的小安麦尔已经不记得它啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和善的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“汐斯塔”呀......它是一颗未成熟的橙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和善的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......是“汐斯塔”让我们这群候羽变成了留羽，“汐斯塔”是我们搭建起的家园。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"候羽......留羽......？爷爷说的......我不太懂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和善的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用着急，小家伙。总有一天你会明白的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来，安麦尔的爷爷也讲过类似的故事啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，科斯达先生......我又想起过去的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很能体会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时至如今，我也很怀念和爷爷相处的时光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，这些永不褪色的回忆，并不会阻碍我向前看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"忽然，一阵乐声响起，少女循着旋律望去。\n她看见乐器店的那扇绛色大门敞开，昏黄的灯光落在那些大大小小的包装箱上。\n老板和工人们席地而坐，他们手持着吉他、手鼓、沙铃......还有一些叫不上名的地方乐器。\n一个不和谐音响起，大家纷纷停下手中的动作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐器店女老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂，是谁又弹错了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？可能是我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可在我的家乡，这个小节就是这么弹的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐器店女老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这样，那就一起调整一下吧！"},{"type":"narration","text":"一些人更改了和弦，一些人放慢了节拍。工人并未更改他的音符，这一小节却重新变得和谐起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乐器店女老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"三、二、一，再一起来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"众人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它是手掌上麻绳磨出的茧，也是肩膀上砖瓦留下的灰♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"众人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它是我们相聚时欢笑的酒，也是我们分离时告别的歌♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"众人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里是汐斯塔，这里是我们的家♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里......就是汐斯塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，这就是汐斯塔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我是安麦尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说，为了表示歉意，帮我约到了一个建筑公司的面试？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可能还是要拒绝您的好意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......今天的事我也有错。还是非常感谢您，嗯，再联络。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市政厅的电话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么拒绝了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是因为我或许能理解候羽和留羽所代表的含义了吧......不，也不能说完全理解了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，就像你说过的那样，我还有的是时间来了解这座城市......我也想先放慢脚步，来了解这座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我......决定接下这份工作了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女望着那间落灰的小店。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在规定的期限内，我会把这些旧家具都清空，再把墙壁重新粉刷一遍，让这间屋子回到它最初的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安麦尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1015_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这就是我在汐斯塔的第一份工作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
